  "description": "Golden parser fixtures (T04-03, ADR-0002): TypeScript source -> expected units {unit_kind, byte span, local_name, kind, anchor, parent} and classified unresolved references. Implementation-specific sig hashes / full serialized locators are pinned in crate-local goldens, not here (neutrality for JS/Rust reuse).",
